  "limitations": [
    "Two of three corpora failed to produce a passing seed. The completed corpus is a pilot; it does not replace the missing comparisons.",
    "One session per strategy on the completed corpus; its eight task batches are not eight independent study repetitions.",
    "The native single-corpus decision and the overall three-corpus finding have different scopes.",
    "Equal resource ceilings do not mean equal spending. Per-strategy totals include the full shared seed cost; the realized study total counts that seed once and includes both failed seed searches.",
    "Model calls are independent. Fixed and retained use the same program but can return different outputs; the optimizer comparison does not isolate the causal effect of format repairs.",
    "Learning label accuracy and the final task pass rate measure different things. Final programs are held fixed, but still make model calls.",
    "Work units, model calls, and token usage are recorded runtime accounting, not provider billing. Provider charges are unavailable.",
    "Content hashes and offline replay check recorded execution; they are not cryptographic signatures, independent labels, or provider attestation.",
    "Synthetic tasks, one model route, and the reused v4 learning corpus do not establish general or production effectiveness."
  ]
